    "short_description": "Hello everyone! My name is Jane, and I need your help! I travel around the world and create a blog about local restaurants and cuisine. I\u2019ve seen how big corporations squeeze out talented local cooks and their restaurants! Let\u2019s take matters into our own hands and give them back their zest for life!",
